
Join কী?
Join = একাধিক টেবিলের data combine করা

👉 ধরো:
Customers (customer info)
Orders (order info)

👉 যদি জানতে চাও:
➡️ কোন customer কোন order করেছে
➡️ তখন JOIN দরকার


INNER JOIN (সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ)
👉 Common data only return করে


----Structured of Inner Joins----
SELECT 
c.FirstName,
o.Product
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
ON c.Id = o.CustomerId;


LEFT JOIN (Left table priority)
👉 Left table এর সব data + matching right


----Structured of left Joins----
SELECT 
c.FirstName, 
o.Product
FROM Customers c
LEFT JOIN Orders o
ON c.Id = o.CustomerId;


RIGHT JOIN
👉 Right table এর সব data + matching left


----Structured of Right Joins----
SELECT 
c.FirstName,
o.Product
FROM Customers c
RIGHT JOIN Orders o
ON c.Id = o.CustomerId;



FULL JOIN
👉 দুই টেবিলের সব data



----Structured of Full Joins----
SELECT 
c.FirstName, 
o.Product
FROM Customers c
FULL JOIN Orders o
ON c.Id = o.CustomerId;

